6
00:02:05.583 --> 00:02:07.085 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好吃</c.simplifiedchinese>

7
00:02:07.168 --> 00:02:08.086 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
