9
00:02:11.881 --> 00:02:12.966 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那倒未必</c.simplifiedchinese>

10
00:02:13.049 --> 00:02:16.386 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>之前薰小姐做过一次
