12
00:02:20.723 --> 00:02:23.601 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是暴力的小姑娘呢</c.simplifiedchinese>

13
00:02:24.644 --> 00:02:28.148 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>抛弃她 然后投入我的怀抱如何？</c.simplifiedchinese>

14
00:02:28.648 --> 00:02:31.985 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>惠小姐…</c.simplifiedchinese>

15
00:02:34.654 --> 00:02:37.448 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>稍微松懈一点 你马上就这样！</c.simplifiedchinese>

16
00:02:37.532 --> 00:02:40.493 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我跟你说过吧
敢对剑心出手就把你扫地出门！</c.simplifiedchinese>

17
00:02:40.577 --> 00:02:43.621 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>哎呀 选择喜欢谁是他的自由</c.simplifiedchinese>

18
00:02:44.747 --> 00:02:47.500 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你每次都这样责难我</c.simplifiedchinese>

19
00:02:47.584 --> 00:02:50.044 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>只能暴露你对自己的不自信</c.simplifiedchinese>

20
00:02:51.045 --> 00:02:55.758 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不甘心的话
不如学学怎么把萩饼做得好吃</c.simplifiedchinese>

21
00:02:56.259 --> 00:02:57.552 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是没话反驳</c.simplifiedchinese>

22
00:02:59.470 --> 00:03:01.598 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我以为她会变得更娴静点</c.simplifiedchinese>

23
00:03:01.681 --> 00:03:03.892 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没想到还是一样</c.simplifiedchinese>

24
00:03:03.975 --> 00:03:08.730 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是她比以前更开朗更有活力了</c.simplifiedchinese>

25
00:03:09.480 --> 00:03:10.607 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是好事啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

26
00:03:10.690 --> 00:03:12.066 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>哪里好！</c.simplifiedchinese>

27
00:03:12.150 --> 00:03:15.194 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>一大早你们在吵吵闹闹说什么呢？</c.simplifiedchinese>

28
00:03:15.278 --> 00:03:16.571 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>啊 阿左</c.simplifiedchinese>

29
00:03:16.654 --> 00:03:18.823 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>老头看过了</c.simplifiedchinese>

30
00:03:18.907 --> 00:03:22.827 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>市面上流通的确实是新型鸦片</c.simplifiedchinese>

31
00:03:23.912 --> 00:03:25.288 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样啊…</c.simplifiedchinese>

32
00:03:27.624 --> 00:03:30.084 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>吃过早饭了吗？要不要来点？</c.simplifiedchinese>

33
00:03:30.168 --> 00:03:31.210 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不必了</c.simplifiedchinese>

34
00:03:31.794 --> 00:03:36.925 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我宁愿吃小姑娘做的
也不吃这个鸦片女做的食物</c.simplifiedchinese>

35
00:03:40.678 --> 00:03:42.931 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我昨晚一夜没睡</c.simplifiedchinese>

36
00:03:43.014 --> 00:03:46.100 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>一会找个房间睡觉
中午记得叫我起来</c.simplifiedchinese>

37
00:03:46.184 --> 00:03:47.936 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>给我站住！</c.simplifiedchinese>

38
00:03:48.019 --> 00:03:50.188 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>说了那么过分的话
不能就这样走了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

39
00:03:50.271 --> 00:03:51.606 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>算了…</c.simplifiedchinese>

40
00:03:52.899 --> 00:03:55.360 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>惠小姐 请别往心里去</c.simplifiedchinese>

41
00:03:56.945 --> 00:03:59.697 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他知道你是做鸦片的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

42
00:04:00.198 --> 00:04:02.617 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但同时也了解了你的过去</c.simplifiedchinese>

43
00:04:03.117 --> 00:04:05.578 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他想责怪你但是又做不到</c.simplifiedchinese>

44
00:04:06.704 --> 00:04:08.623 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>除此之外</c.simplifiedchinese>

45
00:04:08.706 --> 00:04:11.084 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们一周没有听到观柳的行动了</c.simplifiedchinese>

46
00:04:12.418 --> 00:04:13.419 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他挥起了拳头</c.simplifiedchinese>

47
00:04:13.503 --> 00:04:16.422 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>又不知道该怎么做</c.simplifiedchinese>

48
00:04:17.048 --> 00:04:19.592 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以心里难免有点烦躁</c.simplifiedchinese>

49
00:04:20.927 --> 00:04:23.346 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>给他一点时间吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

50
00:04:27.475 --> 00:04:29.894 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>鸦片女…</c.simplifiedchinese>

51
00:04:31.229 --> 00:04:32.397 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你好</c.simplifiedchinese>

52
00:04:32.480 --> 00:04:34.941 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>多谢你们照顾我生意</c.simplifiedchinese>

53
00:04:35.024 --> 00:04:36.526 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我是租书人</c.simplifiedchinese>

54
00:04:36.609 --> 00:04:39.112 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>最近入手了很多新书</c.simplifiedchinese>

55
00:04:39.195 --> 00:04:40.989 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-要看看吗？
-嗯…</c.simplifiedchinese>

56
00:04:41.990 --> 00:04:45.118 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>小姑娘 最近经常看到你呢</c.simplifiedchinese>

57
00:04:45.201 --> 00:04:47.453 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>刚搬到这里吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

58
00:04:47.537 --> 00:04:50.581 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不 我只是暂住…</c.simplifiedchinese>

59
00:04:50.665 --> 00:04:52.166 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

60
00:04:53.001 --> 00:04:54.627 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那真是太好了</c.simplifiedchinese>

61
00:04:56.045 --> 00:04:57.588 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>别出声</c.simplifiedchinese>

62
00:04:57.672 --> 00:05:01.050 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>挣扎的话 就用这个把你扔到井里</c.simplifiedchinese>

63
00:05:01.134 --> 00:05:02.427 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>水银！</c.simplifiedchinese>

64
00:05:02.510 --> 00:05:06.139 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>武田观柳有话跟你说</c.simplifiedchinese>

65
00:05:06.222 --> 00:05:08.850 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>麻烦你走一趟</c.simplifiedchinese>

66
00:05:14.522 --> 00:05:16.065 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你有什么话想说？</c.simplifiedchinese>

67
00:05:17.650 --> 00:05:20.361 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不说你也知道吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

68
00:05:20.445 --> 00:05:23.281 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>差不多该回来了吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

69
00:05:23.906 --> 00:05:27.035 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>比起回到你那 我宁愿去死</c.simplifiedchinese>

70
00:05:27.118 --> 00:05:28.786 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

71
00:05:29.287 --> 00:05:31.164 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你要是不回来…</c.simplifiedchinese>

72
00:05:32.123 --> 00:05:34.751 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我就火烧神谷道场</c.simplifiedchinese>

73
00:05:35.877 --> 00:05:40.548 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我的私兵团、御庭番众、附近的黑道</c.simplifiedchinese>

74
00:05:40.631 --> 00:05:42.842 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>大约五百人把道场团团包围</c.simplifiedchinese>

75
00:05:42.925 --> 00:05:48.097 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>连只老鼠都逃不出去 然后放火</c.simplifiedchinese>

76
00:05:48.681 --> 00:05:52.310 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>“杜鹃不啼 则杀之”</c.simplifiedchinese>

77
00:05:55.646 --> 00:05:58.816 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是时候放弃幻想了吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

78
00:05:59.400 --> 00:06:00.318 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你做的鸦片</c.simplifiedchinese>

79
00:06:00.401 --> 00:06:04.197 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>害死了那么多人 是不容质疑的事实</c.simplifiedchinese>

80
00:06:04.280 --> 00:06:06.616 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>就算再见到你的家人</c.simplifiedchinese>

81
00:06:06.699 --> 00:06:11.621 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>高荷家的女儿竟然做出这种事
他们知道了会怎么想？</c.simplifiedchinese>

82
00:06:12.121 --> 00:06:15.541 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在逃跑也没什么意义了</c.simplifiedchinese>

83
00:06:15.625 --> 00:06:20.046 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你、我还有鸦片都在同一条船上</c.simplifiedchinese>

84
00:06:20.546 --> 00:06:22.799 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>今后也是一样</c.simplifiedchinese>

85
00:06:23.925 --> 00:06:27.428 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>对了 今晚零点火烧道场</c.simplifiedchinese>

86
00:06:27.512 --> 00:06:31.641 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>时间不多了 好好考虑抓紧决定吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

87
00:06:31.724 --> 00:06:32.975 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>再见</c.simplifiedchinese>

88
00:06:36.729 --> 00:06:39.524 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你觉得那个女人会回来吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

89
00:06:40.024 --> 00:06:42.443 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>要是她不回来就麻烦了</c.simplifiedchinese>

90
00:06:42.527 --> 00:06:48.241 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那个带着刀疤的男人
就是传奇刽子手绯村拔刀斋</c.simplifiedchinese>

91
00:06:48.324 --> 00:06:53.913 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>比起用强 避免跟他冲突更加明智</c.simplifiedchinese>

92
00:06:53.996 --> 00:06:57.542 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>高荷惠自愿离开</c.simplifiedchinese>

93
00:06:57.625 --> 00:07:02.255 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样拔刀斋也就没有理由插手了</c.simplifiedchinese>

94
00:07:03.673 --> 00:07:05.758 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>理由吗…</c.simplifiedchinese>

95
00:07:08.761 --> 00:07:10.096 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我逃不掉了</c.simplifiedchinese>

96
00:07:10.972 --> 00:07:12.557 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>逃离不了观柳</c.simplifiedchinese>

97
00:07:12.640 --> 00:07:13.933 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>逃离不了鸦片</c.simplifiedchinese>

98
00:07:14.851 --> 00:07:16.727 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这一辈子都逃脱不了</c.simplifiedchinese>

99
00:07:19.397 --> 00:07:20.898 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>鸦片女…</c.simplifiedchinese>

100
00:07:25.194 --> 00:07:26.237 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>敬启者</c.simplifiedchinese>

101
00:07:26.320 --> 00:07:30.450 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然很任性 但请原谅我的不告而别</c.simplifiedchinese>

102
00:07:31.409 --> 00:07:36.789 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>观柳和他的手下似乎已经放弃了
我也是时候回会津了</c.simplifiedchinese>

103
00:07:37.415 --> 00:07:41.335 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>谢谢你们过去十天对我的照顾</c.simplifiedchinese>

104
00:07:42.086 --> 00:07:45.506 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>“草草不能尽言 高荷惠”</c.simplifiedchinese>

105
00:07:45.590 --> 00:07:48.718 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>感觉有点伤心呢</c.simplifiedchinese>

106
00:07:50.386 --> 00:07:51.345 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>假的！</c.simplifiedchinese>

107
00:07:51.429 --> 00:07:52.805 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心？</c.simplifiedchinese>

108
00:07:52.889 --> 00:07:56.767 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在会津根本没人在等惠小姐</c.simplifiedchinese>

109
00:07:58.102 --> 00:08:01.105 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>观柳的人一定趁我们不在威胁了她</c.simplifiedchinese>

110
00:08:01.189 --> 00:08:04.233 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿左 你知不知道观柳的宅邸在哪？</c.simplifiedchinese>

111
00:08:04.317 --> 00:08:05.234 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们走</c.simplifiedchinese>

112
00:08:05.318 --> 00:08:06.319 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你去吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

113
00:08:06.819 --> 00:08:11.449 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>为什么我要去救那个鸦片女？</c.simplifiedchinese>

114
00:08:11.532 --> 00:08:12.825 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>左之助！</c.simplifiedchinese>

115
00:08:12.909 --> 00:08:15.411 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你什么时候开始总说这种丧气话…</c.simplifiedchinese>

116
00:08:15.912 --> 00:08:17.705 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>够了 阿左</c.simplifiedchinese>

117
00:08:18.539 --> 00:08:20.041 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>一点也不像你</c.simplifiedchinese>

118
00:08:25.755 --> 00:08:28.925 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我的朋友啊 他在街上卖糖</c.simplifiedchinese>

119
00:08:29.717 --> 00:08:36.057 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好赌博 但也喜欢买糖孩子的笑脸
是个草包 但人不坏</c.simplifiedchinese>

120
00:08:36.557 --> 00:08:40.520 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是就这样被她做的鸦片害死了</c.simplifiedchinese>

121
00:08:41.562 --> 00:08:45.358 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我到底有什么理由去帮她？</c.simplifiedchinese>

122
00:08:45.441 --> 00:08:50.071 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不像你那么老好人 也不是浪客！</c.simplifiedchinese>

123
00:08:55.910 --> 00:09:00.957 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿左 你没仔细看过惠小姐的眼神吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

124
00:09:01.040 --> 00:09:02.124 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>眼神？</c.simplifiedchinese>

125
00:09:02.792 --> 00:09:08.422 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>她表现得很坚强
但偶尔眼神里会流露出孤独</c.simplifiedchinese>

126
00:09:09.840 --> 00:09:10.800 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

127
00:09:11.801 --> 00:09:13.594 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>告诉观柳</c.simplifiedchinese>

128
00:09:14.095 --> 00:09:17.014 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>高荷惠回来了</c.simplifiedchinese>

129
00:09:18.015 --> 00:09:23.312 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>她的眼神透露着
她渴望拥有家人一样可以信任的伙伴</c.simplifiedchinese>

130
00:09:23.980 --> 00:09:27.233 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果每个行动非要有特定的理由</c.simplifiedchinese>

131
00:09:27.775 --> 00:09:30.278 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这个理由对在下来说就已经足够</c.simplifiedchinese>

132
00:09:34.031 --> 00:09:35.950 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心 我也去</c.simplifiedchinese>

133
00:09:36.033 --> 00:09:37.660 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦 等等！</c.simplifiedchinese>

134
00:09:37.743 --> 00:09:39.745 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你去只会拖后腿的</c.simplifiedchinese>

135
00:09:39.829 --> 00:09:40.955 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>少废话！</c.simplifiedchinese>

136
00:09:41.038 --> 00:09:43.791 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那个女人救了我一命！</c.simplifiedchinese>

137
00:09:43.874 --> 00:09:46.419 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>就算拼了这条命 我也要去救她</c.simplifiedchinese>

138
00:09:46.502 --> 00:09:50.256 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>要是我连这都做不到
还说什么“神谷活心流是救人剑”</c.simplifiedchinese>

139
00:09:54.969 --> 00:09:59.056 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这孩子不知不觉间
也成长为一个真正的剑客了…</c.simplifiedchinese>

140
00:10:00.016 --> 00:10:02.268 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这次可能要彻夜不归了</c.simplifiedchinese>

141
00:10:02.351 --> 00:10:06.397 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>别忘了准备好五人份的洗澡水和早饭</c.simplifiedchinese>

142
00:10:06.897 --> 00:10:08.316 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>左之助</c.simplifiedchinese>

143
00:10:10.776 --> 00:10:13.154 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我决定不想那么多了</c.simplifiedchinese>

144
00:10:13.738 --> 00:10:17.241 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>接下来拿出我的作风 去大闹一场</c.simplifiedchinese>

145
00:10:18.618 --> 00:10:19.452 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>很好</c.simplifiedchinese>

146
00:10:20.828 --> 00:10:21.871 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们走！</c.simplifiedchinese>

147
00:10:28.044 --> 00:10:30.630 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这里就是观柳的宅邸</c.simplifiedchinese>

148
00:10:30.713 --> 00:10:31.922 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没错</c.simplifiedchinese>

149
00:10:32.423 --> 00:10:34.717 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你准备怎么攻入？</c.simplifiedchinese>

150
00:10:34.800 --> 00:10:37.553 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>人手稀少的奇袭要以速度取胜</c.simplifiedchinese>

151
00:10:37.637 --> 00:10:41.432 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>破开大门后全力冲到入口</c.simplifiedchinese>

152
00:10:41.515 --> 00:10:43.601 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>就是从正面进攻啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

153
00:10:43.684 --> 00:10:45.311 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>懂了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

154
00:10:45.394 --> 00:10:46.395 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>左之助</c.simplifiedchinese>

155
00:10:47.104 --> 00:10:49.649 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>可别落在我后面了 明白？</c.simplifiedchinese>

156
00:10:52.568 --> 00:10:53.653 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们走</c.simplifiedchinese>

157
00:10:55.821 --> 00:10:57.323 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-怎么了？
-看我的！</c.simplifiedchinese>

158
00:11:03.204 --> 00:11:05.373 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>欢迎回来 惠</c.simplifiedchinese>

159
00:11:05.456 --> 00:11:08.209 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我就知道你一定会回来的</c.simplifiedchinese>

160
00:11:08.709 --> 00:11:12.338 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>毕竟除了这里 你无处可去</c.simplifiedchinese>

161
00:11:12.421 --> 00:11:16.300 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>而且蜘蛛网的存货快要卖光了</c.simplifiedchinese>

162
00:11:16.884 --> 00:11:18.636 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>快多做一点吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

163
00:11:21.889 --> 00:11:23.808 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是头疼啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

164
00:11:23.891 --> 00:11:26.435 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你总是想着反抗</c.simplifiedchinese>

165
00:11:26.519 --> 00:11:30.147 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>明明这么可爱…</c.simplifiedchinese>

166
00:11:30.231 --> 00:11:34.568 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你觉得可爱的
是我做的鸦片帮你获取的利润吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

167
00:11:35.069 --> 00:11:35.986 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没错</c.simplifiedchinese>

168
00:11:36.487 --> 00:11:40.324 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>赚来的利润让你显得格外可爱</c.simplifiedchinese>

169
00:11:40.825 --> 00:11:42.034 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是啊…</c.simplifiedchinese>

170
00:11:42.118 --> 00:11:45.913 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>可惜 我回来不是帮你做鸦片的</c.simplifiedchinese>

171
00:11:46.414 --> 00:11:47.248 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

172
00:11:47.331 --> 00:11:50.543 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>武田观柳 我回来取你性命</c.simplifiedchinese>

173
00:11:52.086 --> 00:11:53.879 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>别担心</c.simplifiedchinese>

174
00:11:53.963 --> 00:11:56.048 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你和我是同一条船上的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

175
00:11:56.132 --> 00:11:58.008 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>杀了你之后我会立刻自杀</c.simplifiedchinese>

176
00:11:59.677 --> 00:12:02.721 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不想再背负着罪孽活下去了</c.simplifiedchinese>

177
00:12:02.805 --> 00:12:05.349 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>一起坠入地狱吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

178
00:12:05.850 --> 00:12:10.146 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>就算是对因鸦片受苦的人赎罪了…</c.simplifiedchinese>

179
00:12:15.401 --> 00:12:16.777 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我的刀…</c.simplifiedchinese>

180
00:12:17.445 --> 00:12:18.737 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>到此为止吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

181
00:12:23.784 --> 00:12:25.870 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你…</c.simplifiedchinese>

182
00:12:25.953 --> 00:12:27.079 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你这臭女人！</c.simplifiedchinese>

183
00:12:29.415 --> 00:12:33.002 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>之前对那个大夫态度强硬失败了</c.simplifiedchinese>

184
00:12:33.085 --> 00:12:36.881 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以对你好一点 你竟敢蹬鼻子上脸</c.simplifiedchinese>

185
00:12:37.548 --> 00:12:40.426 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>竟敢小看我观柳大人！</c.simplifiedchinese>

186
00:12:44.346 --> 00:12:45.931 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>召集私兵团</c.simplifiedchinese>

187
00:12:46.015 --> 00:12:48.726 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>严刑拷问
让她吐出鸦片的制作方法！</c.simplifiedchinese>

188
00:12:48.809 --> 00:12:51.437 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>所有人都在外面</c.simplifiedchinese>

189
00:12:51.520 --> 00:12:52.730 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

190
00:12:52.813 --> 00:12:54.315 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>听</c.simplifiedchinese>

191
00:12:55.733 --> 00:12:58.068 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是…紧急集合哨</c.simplifiedchinese>

192
00:12:58.777 --> 00:13:00.112 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那个男人…</c.simplifiedchinese>

193
00:13:00.613 --> 00:13:01.655 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他来了</c.simplifiedchinese>

194
00:13:08.370 --> 00:13:10.539 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好快…太快了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

195
00:13:10.623 --> 00:13:11.457 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是人类吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

196
00:13:11.540 --> 00:13:13.000 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂！</c.simplifiedchinese>

197
00:13:13.083 --> 00:13:14.585 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>别给我分心啊…</c.simplifiedchinese>

198
00:13:14.668 --> 00:13:16.170 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>会受伤的！</c.simplifiedchinese>

199
00:13:21.050 --> 00:13:22.384 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>左之助</c.simplifiedchinese>

200
00:13:22.885 --> 00:13:24.678 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这么慢可不行啊！</c.simplifiedchinese>

201
00:13:25.262 --> 00:13:27.640 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>小屁孩 胡说什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

202
00:13:28.307 --> 00:13:29.600 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好…好强…</c.simplifiedchinese>

203
00:13:29.683 --> 00:13:31.810 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这两个人太强了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

204
00:13:31.894 --> 00:13:34.021 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是三人组 蠢货！</c.simplifiedchinese>

205
00:13:36.565 --> 00:13:39.193 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>私兵团和黑道大部分都收拾掉了</c.simplifiedchinese>

206
00:13:40.903 --> 00:13:41.987 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>火枪队！</c.simplifiedchinese>

207
00:13:42.071 --> 00:13:43.572 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>瞄准！</c.simplifiedchinese>

208
00:13:43.656 --> 00:13:44.949 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>射…</c.simplifiedchinese>

209
00:13:48.202 --> 00:13:49.703 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>就现在！射击！</c.simplifiedchinese>

210
00:13:49.787 --> 00:13:50.996 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿左！弥彦！</c.simplifiedchinese>

211
00:13:51.080 --> 00:13:52.706 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-弥彦！
-在！</c.simplifiedchinese>

212
00:13:52.790 --> 00:13:54.333 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>轮到你出场了</c.simplifiedchinese>

213
00:13:54.416 --> 00:13:56.669 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>给他们点颜色看！</c.simplifiedchinese>

214
00:13:58.754 --> 00:14:00.381 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>臭小鬼！</c.simplifiedchinese>

215
00:14:01.840 --> 00:14:04.260 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你在找这把枪吗 大叔？</c.simplifiedchinese>

216
00:14:05.427 --> 00:14:08.514 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>扒手技能竟然在这派上了用场</c.simplifiedchinese>

217
00:14:08.597 --> 00:14:12.101 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>人生真是充满了奇遇啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

218
00:14:13.018 --> 00:14:14.186 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>砰！</c.simplifiedchinese>

219
00:14:16.313 --> 00:14:17.356 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>蠢货</c.simplifiedchinese>

220
00:14:17.439 --> 00:14:19.316 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你以为我会开枪吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

221
00:14:19.400 --> 00:14:21.318 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我可是剑客</c.simplifiedchinese>

222
00:14:21.402 --> 00:14:23.612 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我才不用什么枪呢</c.simplifiedchinese>

223
00:14:23.696 --> 00:14:24.905 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>臭小子！</c.simplifiedchinese>

224
00:14:24.989 --> 00:14:26.073 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>少得意忘形！</c.simplifiedchinese>

225
00:14:27.533 --> 00:14:28.409 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>（恶）</c.simplifiedchinese>

226
00:14:29.577 --> 00:14:31.412 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>还好吗 弥彦？</c.simplifiedchinese>

227
00:14:31.495 --> 00:14:33.789 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>当然没事</c.simplifiedchinese>

228
00:14:33.873 --> 00:14:36.667 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在叫我回去 我也不会回去</c.simplifiedchinese>

229
00:14:36.750 --> 00:14:38.752 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好 就是这股志气</c.simplifiedchinese>

230
00:14:38.836 --> 00:14:41.046 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>可别落后了 弥彦</c.simplifiedchinese>

231
00:14:41.130 --> 00:14:42.256 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>少废话！</c.simplifiedchinese>

232
00:14:42.339 --> 00:14:46.594 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你这家伙
刚才怎么突然就把我扔出去了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

233
00:14:46.677 --> 00:14:48.804 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我这是给你创造出场机会</c.simplifiedchinese>

234
00:14:48.888 --> 00:14:50.639 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你该感谢我才对</c.simplifiedchinese>

235
00:14:50.723 --> 00:14:52.141 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不懂</c.simplifiedchinese>

236
00:14:52.641 --> 00:14:54.059 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>为什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

237
00:14:54.143 --> 00:14:57.313 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>绯村拔刀斋到底有什么理由…</c.simplifiedchinese>

238
00:14:57.396 --> 00:15:01.734 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>为了那个女人追到这里
究竟有什么好处？</c.simplifiedchinese>

239
00:15:01.817 --> 00:15:05.738 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>刽子手拔刀斋不是在乎得失的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

240
00:15:06.238 --> 00:15:09.074 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>否则他现在早就是陆军军官了</c.simplifiedchinese>

241
00:15:10.659 --> 00:15:13.454 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你这种生意人不会明白的</c.simplifiedchinese>

242
00:15:13.537 --> 00:15:15.414 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然跟我们立场不同</c.simplifiedchinese>

243
00:15:15.497 --> 00:15:22.004 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但维新志士和我们一样
都是愿意为了信仰赴死的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

244
00:15:22.630 --> 00:15:27.885 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>如今这个世道
许多维新志士已经腐化堕落</c.simplifiedchinese>

245
00:15:28.636 --> 00:15:31.305 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但他似乎仍然过的不错</c.simplifiedchinese>

246
00:15:31.889 --> 00:15:36.060 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>竟然引出了十年未曾现身的维新志士</c.simplifiedchinese>

247
00:15:36.852 --> 00:15:41.857 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这个男人就是我们
江户城御庭番众的猎物</c.simplifiedchinese>

248
00:15:41.941 --> 00:15:44.109 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>开…开什么玩笑！</c.simplifiedchinese>

249
00:15:44.193 --> 00:15:48.030 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>与传说中的刽子手为敌
实在太危险了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

250
00:15:48.113 --> 00:15:49.448 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>别那么说</c.simplifiedchinese>

251
00:15:50.157 --> 00:15:52.117 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们很想和他一战</c.simplifiedchinese>

252
00:15:56.497 --> 00:15:57.748 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>观柳</c.simplifiedchinese>

253
00:15:57.831 --> 00:15:59.375 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是时候赎罪了</c.simplifiedchinese>

254
00:15:59.458 --> 00:16:01.585 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>带着惠小姐下来！</c.simplifiedchinese>

255
00:16:07.883 --> 00:16:08.842 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是？</c.simplifiedchinese>

256
00:16:09.343 --> 00:16:10.886 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>吓到精神错乱了吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

257
00:16:12.930 --> 00:16:14.723 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>非常精彩！</c.simplifiedchinese>

258
00:16:14.807 --> 00:16:18.686 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>一口气就解决了我的五十多个私兵</c.simplifiedchinese>

259
00:16:18.769 --> 00:16:22.564 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不愧是传说中的刽子手绯村拔刀斋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

260
00:16:22.648 --> 00:16:25.651 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这家伙…知道剑心的过去…</c.simplifiedchinese>

261
00:16:25.734 --> 00:16:27.903 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>恐怕御庭番众早就查过了</c.simplifiedchinese>

262
00:16:27.987 --> 00:16:29.780 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>精彩绝伦！</c.simplifiedchinese>

263
00:16:29.863 --> 00:16:34.868 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>有了御庭番众
你再加入我麾下 那就真的无敌了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

264
00:16:34.952 --> 00:16:38.288 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我付给你五十份私兵的工资！</c.simplifiedchinese>

265
00:16:38.372 --> 00:16:41.333 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>如何？做我的保镖吧！</c.simplifiedchinese>

266
00:16:41.417 --> 00:16:43.877 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>下来还是不下来</c.simplifiedchinese>

267
00:16:43.961 --> 00:16:44.837 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>到底怎样？</c.simplifiedchinese>

268
00:16:45.921 --> 00:16:48.007 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那我付一百人份！</c.simplifiedchinese>

269
00:16:49.383 --> 00:16:51.135 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那…二百人份！</c.simplifiedchinese>

270
00:16:51.218 --> 00:16:52.970 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你还不明白</c.simplifiedchinese>

271
00:16:53.470 --> 00:16:56.432 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他不能用金钱收买</c.simplifiedchinese>

272
00:16:57.141 --> 00:17:00.686 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我说过了
绯村拔刀斋不会为利益所动</c.simplifiedchinese>

273
00:17:02.771 --> 00:17:03.897 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

274
00:17:03.981 --> 00:17:06.525 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我懂了 是我输了</c.simplifiedchinese>

275
00:17:06.608 --> 00:17:07.735 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我投降！</c.simplifiedchinese>

276
00:17:07.818 --> 00:17:09.611 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我会交出高荷惠的</c.simplifiedchinese>

277
00:17:09.695 --> 00:17:11.822 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但给我一个小时时间</c.simplifiedchinese>

278
00:17:12.448 --> 00:17:15.409 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>还有许多准备要做 求你了</c.simplifiedchinese>

279
00:17:15.492 --> 00:17:17.745 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>就在那里等着</c.simplifiedchinese>

280
00:17:17.828 --> 00:17:20.873 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你的鬼话谁信啊 混蛋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

281
00:17:25.210 --> 00:17:27.379 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心！等等！</c.simplifiedchinese>

282
00:17:27.463 --> 00:17:29.548 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>轻信别人也该有个度！</c.simplifiedchinese>

283
00:17:29.631 --> 00:17:30.883 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>很好</c.simplifiedchinese>

284
00:17:30.966 --> 00:17:32.968 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>趁这一个小时对高荷惠严加拷问</c.simplifiedchinese>

285
00:17:33.052 --> 00:17:37.181 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>逼出蜘蛛网的制作方法 她就没用了</c.simplifiedchinese>

286
00:17:37.264 --> 00:17:39.641 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不信她能坚持那么久</c.simplifiedchinese>

287
00:18:01.205 --> 00:18:03.791 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>一个小时内我会杀上去！</c.simplifiedchinese>

288
00:18:03.874 --> 00:18:05.834 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>做好准备吧 观柳！</c.simplifiedchinese>

289
00:18:08.128 --> 00:18:10.923 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你的权宜之计只是火上浇油</c.simplifiedchinese>

290
00:18:11.423 --> 00:18:14.259 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此 他果然是个性情中人</c.simplifiedchinese>

291
00:18:14.343 --> 00:18:17.679 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>首…首领…让御庭番众做好准备</c.simplifiedchinese>

292
00:18:17.763 --> 00:18:18.972 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>已经准备好了</c.simplifiedchinese>

293
00:18:20.349 --> 00:18:22.601 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>连接着入口的走廊</c.simplifiedchinese>

294
00:18:22.684 --> 00:18:24.019 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>以及走廊尽头的台阶上</c.simplifiedchinese>

295
00:18:24.937 --> 00:18:27.231 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>安排了我的左膀右臂</c.simplifiedchinese>

296
00:18:28.065 --> 00:18:31.193 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我则负责在舞厅殿后</c.simplifiedchinese>

297
00:18:31.276 --> 00:18:32.486 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>可以</c.simplifiedchinese>

298
00:18:32.569 --> 00:18:36.365 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>别再安排恶见和火男
那种没用的垃圾！</c.simplifiedchinese>

299
00:18:36.448 --> 00:18:41.537 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>领着那么高的薪水却名不副实
我绝不能轻饶</c.simplifiedchinese>

300
00:18:42.830 --> 00:18:47.209 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你说“绝不能轻饶”是什么意思？</c.simplifiedchinese>

301
00:18:48.043 --> 00:18:49.545 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>别搞错了</c.simplifiedchinese>

302
00:18:50.295 --> 00:18:52.923 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>御庭番众听从的不是你的命令</c.simplifiedchinese>

303
00:18:53.632 --> 00:18:55.717 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>而是我的</c.simplifiedchinese>

304
00:18:56.218 --> 00:18:59.179 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我绝不允许有人瞧不起他们</c.simplifiedchinese>

305
00:19:03.016 --> 00:19:05.310 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们的目标是高荷惠</c.simplifiedchinese>

306
00:19:06.145 --> 00:19:09.273 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我会把她关在三楼的观景台</c.simplifiedchinese>

307
00:19:09.982 --> 00:19:14.736 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你别再插手了
留在这清算你的财产吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

308
00:19:28.792 --> 00:19:30.210 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你醒了</c.simplifiedchinese>

309
00:19:30.294 --> 00:19:31.587 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这里是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

310
00:19:31.670 --> 00:19:33.130 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>观景台？</c.simplifiedchinese>

311
00:19:33.213 --> 00:19:34.673 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>究竟…</c.simplifiedchinese>

312
00:19:34.756 --> 00:19:38.802 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>神谷道场的人打来了 想把你带回去</c.simplifiedchinese>

313
00:19:38.886 --> 00:19:40.012 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>骗人…</c.simplifiedchinese>

314
00:19:40.095 --> 00:19:41.638 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我何必骗你？</c.simplifiedchinese>

315
00:19:42.139 --> 00:19:44.808 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们已经消灭了私兵团</c.simplifiedchinese>

316
00:19:46.393 --> 00:19:47.269 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>笨蛋</c.simplifiedchinese>

317
00:19:47.352 --> 00:19:50.522 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>明明我都自己离开了 他们还是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

318
00:19:51.023 --> 00:19:52.232 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>为什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

319
00:19:52.316 --> 00:19:57.237 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>为什么神谷道场这群人
一个两个都这么傻？</c.simplifiedchinese>

320
00:19:59.781 --> 00:20:01.366 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你的短刀</c.simplifiedchinese>

321
00:20:01.450 --> 00:20:02.659 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>还给你</c.simplifiedchinese>

322
00:20:03.452 --> 00:20:05.662 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>最好别抱什么希望</c.simplifiedchinese>

323
00:20:06.163 --> 00:20:08.540 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们不可能打上来</c.simplifiedchinese>

324
00:20:09.208 --> 00:20:13.962 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>一个小时后等待你的不是拯救
而是观柳的拷问</c.simplifiedchinese>

325
00:20:14.046 --> 00:20:17.424 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是痛苦的死 还是安乐的死</c.simplifiedchinese>

326
00:20:18.091 --> 00:20:20.510 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>自己选吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

327
00:20:21.011 --> 00:20:25.807 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>观柳想要的鸦片和钱 我们都不在乎</c.simplifiedchinese>

328
00:20:26.934 --> 00:20:30.646 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们御庭番众渴望的只是战斗本身</c.simplifiedchinese>

329
00:20:31.271 --> 00:20:34.983 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>因此才来替这个走私鸦片的商人卖命</c.simplifiedchinese>

330
00:20:35.484 --> 00:20:38.362 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>多亏了你 现在有了最强的对手</c.simplifiedchinese>

331
00:20:38.445 --> 00:20:40.197 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这算是谢礼</c.simplifiedchinese>

332
00:20:41.406 --> 00:20:45.077 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我虽然有一点同情你的悲惨人生经历</c.simplifiedchinese>

